{"3712060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Island World", "steam_appid": 3712060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a new life on the <strong>Island World</strong>? Keep yourself alive, <strong>level up</strong> and gain <strong>skill points</strong> to spend on whatever you like to build next! <strong>Fight</strong> your <strong>enemies</strong> with <strong>self-crafted weapons and armor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>survival</strong> game mechanics on top a beautiful <strong>stylized Warcraft</strong> like world with over <strong>200 characters levels</strong>, dozens of <strong>armor sets</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong>, <strong>tools</strong> and <strong>buildables</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As decade old fans of the classic World of Warcraft series we wanted to create something within the same feeling but fully offline. Combined with survival mechanics and a wide variety of monsters and bosses to fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leveling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience from harvesting resources, crafting items and defeating your enemies to level up your character and unlock skill- and engram points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillpoints can be used to level up certain aspects of your character to your own needs. Engram points can be used to unlock new crafting recipes to get access to better and stronger weapons, armor, tools and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in any good survival game, you craft your own items, gear, tools and buildings but like in real life, you need resources for that. Every single tree, ore, bush or flower in the world can be chopped down, mined or picked for resources! And with a little time, they also grow back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Crafting Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level you gain you unlock engram points you are free to spend on whatever item you want to craft! Depending on your player character level, better and more epic items will become available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Awesome Weapons and Epic Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing comes from nothing. Instead of buying armor and weapons you are gonna craft them yourself with the resources you collected and the recipes you have unlocked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against dozens of different enemies all over the Island World! From low level enemies in the South to high level enemies in the North. Fight your away across the world or run away from a battle, that's up to you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a new life on the <strong>Island World</strong>? Keep yourself alive, <strong>level up</strong> and gain <strong>skill points</strong> to spend on whatever you like to build next! <strong>Fight</strong> your <strong>enemies</strong> with <strong>self-crafted weapons and armor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>survival</strong> game mechanics on top a beautiful <strong>stylized Warcraft</strong> like world with over <strong>200 characters levels</strong>, dozens of <strong>armor sets</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong>, <strong>tools</strong> and <strong>buildables</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As decade old fans of the classic World of Warcraft series we wanted to create something within the same feeling but fully offline. Combined with survival mechanics and a wide variety of monsters and bosses to fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leveling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience from harvesting resources, crafting items and defeating your enemies to level up your character and unlock skill- and engram points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillpoints can be used to level up certain aspects of your character to your own needs. Engram points can be used to unlock new crafting recipes to get access to better and stronger weapons, armor, tools and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in any good survival game, you craft your own items, gear, tools and buildings but like in real life, you need resources for that. Every single tree, ore, bush or flower in the world can be chopped down, mined or picked for resources! And with a little time, they also grow back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Crafting Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level you gain you unlock engram points you are free to spend on whatever item you want to craft! Depending on your player character level, better and more epic items will become available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Awesome Weapons and Epic Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing comes from nothing. Instead of buying armor and weapons you are gonna craft them yourself with the resources you collected and the recipes you have unlocked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against dozens of different enemies all over the Island World! From low level enemies in the South to high level enemies in the North. Fight your away across the world or run away from a battle, that's up to you.</p>", "short_description": "Are you ready for a new life on the Island World? Keep yourself alive, level up and gain skill points to spend on whatever you like to build next! Fight your enemies with self-crafted weapons and armor.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712060/7d33d466ca723eef527f473fa8350cb6185882a6/header.jpg?t=1755096559", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712060/e888061f34166427122a